title: The Military Creation Act
subtitle: Should the Republic build an army?
tags: event
view-if: date >= 132 and dooku_movement and not war and not mca_seen
max-visits: 1
priority: 3
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: mca_seen = 1; crisis_months = 4

= The Military Creation Act

With [+ seceded_total +]% of the Senate's delegations gone and more leaving every month, the Security Bloc has tabled the **Military Creation Act**: a standing army of the Republic, the first since the Ruusan Reformation. [? if pal_chancellor : The Chancellor says he would "never wish for war", but that the Senate must decide. ?]

*Events will now move month by month.*

- @oppose: Oppose the Act. An army will make war inevitable.
- @support: Support the Act. The Republic must defend itself.
- @oversight: Support it only with permanent Senate oversight of the army.
- @judicials: Propose expanding the Judicial Forces instead.

@oppose
subtitle: The Pacifists cheer; the Hawks fume.
on-arrival: {!
var st = SW.stance(Q, {pal: 0.8, sec: 0.95, mod: 0.4 + Q.fear / 200, guild: 0.45, ind: 0.4 + Q.fear / 250, rim: 0.3, rfc: 0.25, cis: 0.05}, false);
Q.mca_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 0, 'army');
Q.mca_result = Q.mca_vote >= 50 ? 'passed' : 'failed';
Q.pacifist_dissent -= 6; Q.hawk_dissent += 8;
!}
go-to: mca_result_scene

@support
subtitle: The Hawks cheer; the Pacifists fume.
on-arrival: {!
var st = SW.stance(Q, {pal: 0.8, sec: 0.95, mod: 0.4 + Q.fear / 200, guild: 0.45, ind: 0.4 + Q.fear / 250, rim: 0.3, rfc: 0.25, cis: 0.05}, false);
Q.mca_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, 'army');
Q.mca_result = Q.mca_vote >= 50 ? 'passed' : 'failed';
Q.hawk_dissent -= 6; Q.pacifist_dissent += 8;
!}
go-to: mca_result_scene

@oversight
subtitle: −1 political capital. An army that answers to the Senate.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {pal: 0.35, sec: 0.6, mod: 0.6 + Q.fear / 250, guild: 0.45, ind: 0.55, rim: 0.4, rfc: 0.35, cis: 0.05}, true);
Q.mca_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, ['army', 'oversight']);
Q.mca_result = Q.mca_vote >= 50 ? 'oversight' : 'failed';
if (Q.mca_result === 'oversight') { Q.army_oversight = 1; Q.navy_loyalty += 10; }
Q.hawk_dissent -= 2; Q.pacifist_dissent += 2;
!}
go-to: mca_result_scene

@judicials
subtitle: −1 political capital. Strengthens the Senate's own forces.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 1;
var st = SW.stance(Q, {pal: 0.3, sec: 0.45, mod: 0.6, guild: 0.4, ind: 0.6, rim: 0.55, rfc: 0.5, cis: 0.1}, true);
Q.mca_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, 'oversight');
Q.mca_result = Q.mca_vote >= 50 ? 'judicials' : 'failed';
if (Q.mca_result === 'judicials') { Q.judicial_forces += 2; Q.judicial_expansion = 1; }
!}
go-to: mca_result_scene

@mca_result_scene

[? if mca_result = "passed" : The Military Creation Act passes. The Republic will have an army, though where it is to come from nobody is quite sure. ?][? if mca_result = "oversight" : The Act passes with the Caucus's amendment: any army of the Republic will answer to a standing Senate oversight committee, with full access to its orders. ?][? if mca_result = "judicials" : Instead of an army, the Senate votes to double the Judicial Forces under its own command. It is a compromise that satisfies no one, and it might just work. ?][? if mca_result = "failed" : The Senate deadlocks. There will be no army, for now. ?]
